      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIL REX (2) recorded a one length win (42.85) in a OPEN last time at this track. Has an unbeaten record from this draw, scoring three times. Expected to go close. ISABELLA'S BLITZ (8) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 43.54. Outside box to overcome but likes the trip. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Deserves serious consideration again. TIME TO FIRE (1) is generally an honest type in the frame at 20 of 59 starts but missed the placings last time when fifth (30.93) over 530m at this track. Solid record here including 13 wins. Has the ability and rates a key chance this line-up. KING OF SNAKE (6) placed last start in slick time and is in the mix again.",
